      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You have no idea how generous 200 megabytes is already as the default limit. If its a showoff avatar, for things like animation or music, you can ask people to enable it but as a default regular everyday avatar there is no way anyone should be walking around in something so big.\nIm curious, is it a showoff avatar or is it unoptimised? post some pictures of the avatar stats if you want to entertain me.",
